# zkml-guarantees

Reproducible evaluation artifact for analyzing cryptographic guarantees of verifiable LLM inference systems (zkLLM, zkGPT, NanoZK, EZKL).

Includes:
- Machine-readable security profiles
- Negative tests for model-substitution attacks
- Cost harness for binding modes
- Small controlled models for end-to-end experiments

## Structure
See Chapter 8 of the thesis for the full design.

